{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/2495-1Q.png'/>", "option1": "ক) (1, 1)", "option2": "খ) (1, 3)", "option3": "গ) (-1, -1)", "option4": "ঘ) (0, 0)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/2495-1E.png\" /></p>\r\n<p>&there4; x - y = 0 <br />বা, x = y<br />এবং<br />x + 2y = 3<br />বা, x + 2x = 3<br />বা, 3x = 3<br />বা, x = 1<br />&there4; y = 1<br />&there4; (x, y) = (1, 1)</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> = 96, x - y = 8 হলে, (x, y) = ?", "option1": "ক) (0, 2)", "option2": "খ) (10, 2)", "option3": "গ) (2, 10)", "option4": "ঘ) (2, 0)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x - y = 8 ............ (1)<br />x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> = 96<br />বা, (x + y)(x - y) = 96<br />বা, (x + y)8 = 96<br />&there4; x + y = 12 ........... (2)<br />(1)নং + (2)নং দ্বারা পাই,<br />2x = 20<br />&there4; x = 10<br />(2) নং হতে পাই<br />10 + y = 12<br />&there4; y = 2<br />&there4; (x, y) = (10, 2)</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 34 এবং xy = 15 হলে, (x, y) = ?", "option1": "ক) (15, 1)", "option2": "খ) (1, 15)", "option3": "গ) (3, 5)", "option4": "ঘ) (3, 6)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>এখানে,<br />xy = 15 = 3 &times; 5 অথবা 1 &times; 15<br />যেখানে, 3<sup>2</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup><br />= 9 + 25<br />= 34</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) x + y = 1 এবং 2x - y - 2 = 0 সরল রেখাদ্বয়ের ছেদবিন্দুর স্থানাংক কত?", "option1": "ক) (0, 0)", "option2": "খ) (0, 1)", "option3": "গ) (1, 0)", "option4": "ঘ) (1, 1)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>প্রদত্ত সমীকরন, x + y = 1 ........... (1) এবং<br />2x - y - 2 = 0 বা, 2x - y = 2 ........... (2)<br />(1) নং + (2) নং &rArr; 3x = 3<br />&there4; x = 1<br />(1) নং &rArr; 1 + y = 1<br />&there4; y = 0<br />&there4; ছেদবিন্দুর স্থানাংক = (1, 0)</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) 10a + b সংখ্যাটি 10b + a অপেক্ষা 27 বেশি যেখানে a = 2b তবে, a = ?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 6", "option3": "গ) 63", "option4": "ঘ) 36", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>10a + b = 10b + a + 27<br />বা, 9a - 9b = 27<br />বা, a - b = 3 .....(1)<br />এবং a = 2b .....(2)<br />বা, 2b - b = 3<br />&there4; b = 3<br />(1) নং &rArr; a = 6</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) 3/x = 3/2 এবং y/4 = 5/2 হলে, (3 + y)/(x + 4) = ?", "option1": "ক) 11/6", "option2": "খ) 13/6", "option3": "গ) 6/11", "option4": "ঘ) 6/13", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>3/x = 3/2<br />বা, x = 2<br />এবং<br />y/4 = 5/2<br />বা, y = 10<br />&there4; (3 + y)/(x + 4) = (3 + 10)/(2 + 4)<br />= 13/6</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) 3<sup>10</sup> + 3<sup>10</sup> + 3<sup>10</sup> = x<sup>11</sup> হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 1/2", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 1/3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>3<sup>10</sup> + 3<sup>10</sup> + 3<sup>10</sup> = x<sup>11</sup><br />বা, 3.3<sup>10</sup> = x<sup>11</sup><br />বা, 3<sup>11</sup> = x<sup>11</sup><br />&there4; x = 3</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) দু'টি সংখ্যার বিয়োগফল 7 এবং গুণফল 60 হলে, বড় সংখ্যাটি কত?", "option1": "ক) 5", "option2": "খ) 6", "option3": "গ) 12", "option4": "ঘ) 20", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>ধরি,<br />সংখ্যাদ্বয় x, y<br />&there4; x - y = 7 .... (1) এবং xy = 60<br />আমরা জানি, (x + y)<sup>2</sup> = (x - y)<sup>2</sup> + 4xy<br />= 7<sup>2</sup> + 4.60<br />= 289<br />&there4; (x + y) = 17 .... (2)<br />(1) এবং (2) নং সমাধান করে পাই, x = 12, y = 5<br /><br /></p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) [4 + 3(3 - 4)<sup>-1</sup>]<sup>-1</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 1/7", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>[4 + 3(3 - 4)<sup>-1</sup>]<sup>-1</sup> <br />= [4 + 3(-1)<sup>-1</sup>]<sup>-1</sup><br />= [4 + 3. 1/(-1)]<sup>-1</sup><br />= (4 - 3)<sup>-1</sup><br />= (1)<sup>-1</sup><br />= 1/1<br />= 1</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) (<sup>3</sup>&radic;3 &times; <sup>3</sup>&radic;2)<sup>9</sup> = কত?", "option1": "ক) 6", "option2": "খ) 36", "option3": "গ) 216", "option4": "ঘ) 1296", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>(<sup>3</sup>&radic;3 &times; <sup>3</sup>&radic;2)<sup>9</sup><br />= (3<sup>1/3</sup>.2<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>9</sup><br />= 6<sup>3</sup><br />= 216</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) (10000)<sup>x/4</sup> = 100 হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) -1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(10000)<sup>x/4</sup> = 100<br />বা, (10<sup>4</sup>)<sup>x/4</sup> = 100<br />বা, 10<sup>x</sup> = 10<sup>2</sup><br />&there4; x = 2</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) (5/2)<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 1 হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) -(1/2)", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1/2", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(5/2)<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 1<br />বা, (5/2)<sup>2x + 1</sup> = (5/2)<sup>0</sup><br />বা, 2x + 1 = 0<br />বা, 2x = -1<br />&there4; x = -(1/2)</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) (5/3)<sup>x - 7</sup> = (3/5)<sup>x - 3</sup> হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 5", "option3": "গ) 7", "option4": "ঘ) 9", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(5/3)<sup>x - 7</sup> = (5/3)<sup>-(x - 3)</sup><br />বা, (5/3)<sup>x - 7</sup> = (5/3)<sup>-x + 3</sup><br />বা, x - 7 = -x + 3<br />বা, 2x = 10<br />&there4; x = 5</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) x<sup>-3</sup> - 0.001 = 0 হলে, x<sup>3</sup> এর মান -", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 1000", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>-3</sup> - 0.001 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>-3</sup> = 0.001<br />বা, (1/x)<sup>3</sup> = (0.1)<sup>3</sup><br />বা, 1/x = 0.1 = 1/10<br />বা, x = 10<br />&there4; x<sup>3</sup> = 1000</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) log<sub>10</sub>(0.0001) = কত?", "option1": "ক) -3", "option2": "খ) -4", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>log<sub>10</sub>(0.0001) = log<sub>10</sub>(10)<sup>-4</sup><br />= (-4)log<sub>10</sub>10<br />= (-4).1<br />= -4</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) log<sub>2&radic;5</sub>400 = x<sup>2</sup> হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>log<sub>2&radic;5</sub>400 = x<sup>2</sup><br />বা, log<sub>2&radic;5</sub>(2&radic;5)<sup>4</sup> = x<sup>2</sup><br />বা, 4log<sub>2&radic;5</sub>2&radic;5 = x<sup>2</sup><br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> = 4<br />&there4; x = 2</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) log<sub>x</sub>27/8 = -3 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) -(2/3)", "option2": "খ) -(3/2)", "option3": "গ) 2/3", "option4": "ঘ) 3/2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>log<sub>x</sub>27/8 = -3<br />বা, x<sup>-3</sup> = 27/8<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> = 8/27<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> = (2/3)<sup>3</sup><br />&there4; x = 2/3</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) log<sub>2</sub>&radic;10 + log<sub>2</sub>&radic;(2/5) = কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1/2", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>log<sub>2</sub>&radic;10 + log<sub>2</sub>&radic;(2/5)<br />= log<sub>2</sub>10<sup>1/2</sup> + log<sub>2</sub>(2/5)<sup>1/2</sup><br />= 1/2 log<sub>2</sub>10 + 1/2 log<sub>2</sub>2/5<br />= 1/2 [log<sub>2</sub>2&times;5 + log<sub>2</sub> 2/5]<br />= 1/2 [log<sub>2</sub>2 + log<sub>2</sub>5 + log<sub>2</sub>2 - log<sub>2</sub>5]<br />= (1/2)(1+1)<br />= 1</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) 81 এর 3 ভিত্তিক লগারিদম কত?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 1/4", "option4": "ঘ) 1/3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>log<sub>3</sub>81<br />= log<sub>3</sub>3<sup>4</sup><br />= 4 log<sub>3</sub>3<br />= 4.1<br />= 4</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) log<sub>5</sub>1 = কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 5", "option4": "ঘ) -1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>a &gt; 0 এবং a &ne; 1 হলে, log<sub>a</sub>1 = 0 [&because; a<sup>0</sup> = 1]</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1440000, "pk": 2495, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 2495}